Hi Avery,

Here's what's new in Zoom Workplace for your account this month.

AI Companion 3
Meeting summaries now include action items with owners, and you can ask "what did we decide about pricing?" across every meeting you attended in the last 90 days. Available at no extra cost on Pro and Business.

Zoom Docs
Turn a meeting summary into a shared doc with one click. Docs live in your Zoom account and sync to Google Drive if you connect it.

Scheduler
Booking pages with round-robin, buffers, and a "no meetings before 9am" rule. Included with Business.

Also: background noise suppression got a big upgrade for open offices, and recordings now transcribe in 34 languages.

